  "DescIdentified": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "This weapon has crushed the bones of many a defiant foe, leaving behind a lingering chill. Its strikes carry the weight of a void, delivering a crushing blow that feels like a death sentence. A dark aura clings to the iron, as if it hungers for the life of those it strikes."
    }
  },
  "Description": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Corroded iron gives way to a blackened head that hums with a low, discordant vibration. The haft is wrapped in cracked leather, slick with a residue that smells of old ash and cold iron."
    }
  },
